 "allowed_sentences": [
  "On a mixed-material model (a tungsten sphere in CuCrZr, water and steel, 14.1 MeV source) meshed into 8 elements (32 activation regions), with the same transport and two CPU threads, ACTINV 1.7.1 with an ENDF/B-VIII.1 activation library took 11.0 s from model to photon source and OpenMC 0.15.3 in flux mode 112 s, with peak working memory of 1.2 GiB and 6.4 GiB (one run each).",
  "On a mixed-material model (a tungsten sphere in CuCrZr, water and steel, 14.1 MeV source) meshed into 64 elements (136 activation regions), with the same transport and two CPU threads, ACTINV 1.7.1 with an ENDF/B-VIII.1 activation library took 13.4 s from model to photon source and OpenMC 0.15.3 in flux mode 180 s, with peak working memory of 1.2 GiB and 6.4 GiB (one run each).",
  "On a mixed-material model (a tungsten sphere in CuCrZr, water and steel, 14.1 MeV source) meshed into 512 elements (776 activation regions), with the same transport and two CPU threads, ACTINV 1.7.1 with an ENDF/B-VIII.1 activation library took 31.8 s from model to photon source and OpenMC 0.15.3 in flux mode 604 s, with peak working memory of 1.3 GiB and 6.5 GiB (one run each).",
  "On a mixed-material model (a tungsten sphere in CuCrZr, water and steel, 14.1 MeV source) meshed into 4,096 elements (5,120 activation regions), with the same transport and two CPU threads, ACTINV 1.7.1 with an ENDF/B-VIII.1 activation library took 155 s from model to photon source and OpenMC 0.15.3 in flux mode 3,432 s, with peak working memory of 1.4 GiB and 7.2 GiB (one run each).",
  "Inside the same 10 GiB memory limit and 4-hour limit per run, ACTINV (with an ENDF/B-VIII.1 activation library) completed meshes up to 32,768 elements (36,208 regions) and OpenMC 0.15.3 in flux mode up to 4,096 elements (5,120 regions); at 13,824 elements OpenMC was stopped by its memory limit."
